<div>
  Collect private SBOMs on Linux agents, check package versions with Awarely Monitor,
  and explicitly synchronize a configured inventory source. Supports npm, Python,
  Java, other Syft ecosystems, Linux hosts and existing CycloneDX inventories.
  Verified tools, Jenkins credentials, assessment coverage and build policies are
  managed without interactive prompts.
